建立东瓯国。","link_td_id":"Q10000532","link_td_number_id":92176,"people_name":"東甌王","people_name_jianti_auto":"东瓯王","people_xingming":"姒摇","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8e892135-db0e-11ef-9db5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":19,"start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8e892136-db0e-11ef-a634-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東甌","place_name_jianti_auto":"东瓯","place_note":"浙江温州","resolved_place_entity_id":358,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8e892137-db0e-11ef-8766-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、苏州府（卷二十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...清、中清、下清江，又东入昆山县界。姚，一作摇。《吴志》：","source_end_index":256,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"663786c7-6dd8-53d6-a9b3-f280dbd76c4a","source_start_index":241,"source_text":"其地本名摇城，汉初越君摇尝居此"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/五、苏州府（卷二十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、温州府（卷九十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，后属会稽郡。后汉因之。三国吴属临海郡。东晋太宁元年，析...","context_before":"《禹贡》扬州地。春秋、战国并属越。秦属闽中郡。","source_end_index":48,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a155ec88-eecb-5312-b107-9601edd16b97","source_start_index":23,"source_text":"汉初为东瓯国[惠帝三年，封越东海王摇于东瓯，是也]"}],"path":"浙江方舆纪要/十一、温州府（卷九十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷九十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，即今浙江温州府地。又建元六年，封无知孙丑为闽繇王，复封...","context_before":"...天下，平百越，置闽中郡。汉高五年，封无知为闽越王[都冶。","source_end_index":124,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8410c6be-5173-5d03-9bbc-ad2bca214e90","source_start_index":108,"source_text":"孝惠三年，分闽越地，封摇为东海王"}],"path":"福建方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷九十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/◎分野（卷一百三十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其时秦南海尉赵陀亦称王，五岭之南皆陀所有也。其于会稽之越...","context_before":"...辨隶属，甚为乖互。勾践灭吴称霸时，未尝有苍梧、郁林之地。","source_end_index":1225,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cb64e26d-35e9-5e60-9f72-44f0654c839b","source_start_index":1203,"source_text":"越灭后十代，至闽君摇，汉复立为越王，都东瓯。"}],"path":"分野/◎分野（卷一百三十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"3夏，五月，立閩越君搖爲東海王。搖與無諸，皆越王句踐之後也，從諸侯滅秦，功多，其民便附，故立之。都東甌，世號東甌王。","content_fanyi":"夏季，五月，朝廷将闽越君摇立为东海王。摇与无诸都是越王句践的后代，曾跟随诸侯推翻秦朝，功劳很多，当地百姓归附他，因此立他为王。他建都东瓯，世人称他为东瓯王。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，五月，立闽越君摇为东海王。摇与无诸，皆越王句践之后也，从诸侯灭秦，功多，其民便附，故立之。都东瓯，世号东瓯王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":964,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8e89211e-db0e-11ef-96bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長安城","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安城","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8e89213a-db0e-11ef-9bef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8e89213b-db0e-11ef-b26f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自元年始作長安城西北方；今年春，又發長安六百里內男女就役；不欲復勞之，故發王侯徒隸。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自元年始作长安城西北方；今年春，又发长安六百里内男女就役；不欲复劳之，故发王侯徒隶。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8e892139-db0e-11ef-92f5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8e89213c-db0e-11ef-87aa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4六月，發諸侯王、列侯徒隸二萬人城長安。","content_fanyi":"六月，朝廷征发诸侯王、列侯属下的二万名刑徒奴隶修筑长安城。","content_jianti_auto":"4六月，发诸侯王、列侯徒隶二万人城长安。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":965,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8e892138-db0e-11ef-a576-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"都廏，大廏也，屬太僕。","note_content_jianti_auto":"都廏，大廏也，属太仆。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8e89213e-db0e-11ef-b596-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"5秋，七月，都廏災。","content_fanyi":"秋季，七月，太仆的马厩失火。","content_jianti_auto":"5秋，七月，都廏灾。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":966,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8e89213d-db0e-11ef-9335-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8e892141-db0e-11ef-bba3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"裴松之","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴松之","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8e892142-db0e-11ef-bed7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"湔氐道","place_name_jianti_auto":"湔氐道","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8e892143-db0e-11ef-b02a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8e892144-db0e-11ef-baeb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"㟭山","place_name_jianti_auto":"㟭山","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8e892145-db0e-11ef-9120-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江水"